# Public Arch packages installed by pacman. Machine-only extras go in private/packages/pacman.list.
# Groups: core shell containers vm fonts desktop apps
# umbriel and its portal come from the CachyOS repo (on plain Arch, use umbriel-git from the AUR).

## core
bat curl git ncdu zsh vim bind-tools gnupg wget aria2 shellcheck wl-clipboard fzf ripgrep unzip fontconfig git-delta base-devel github-cli pacman-contrib bash-completion duf plocate pkgfile zoxide eza mise reflector rebuild-detector

## shell
ghostty btop glances fastfetch zsh-autosuggestions zsh-syntax-highlighting zsh-theme-powerlevel10k neovim

## containers
podman podman-docker podman-compose fuse-overlayfs flatpak podman-desktop

## vm
qemu-desktop libvirt virt-manager dnsmasq edk2-ovmf swtpm

