ttf-firacode-nerd ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd ttf-meslo-nerd ttf-roboto-mono-nerd ttf-ubuntu-nerd ttf-ubuntu-mono-nerd ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols noto-fonts noto-fonts-emoji noto-fonts-cjk

## desktop
umbriel xdg-desktop-portal-umbriel cliphist wlsunset cava matugen ddcutil polkit-gnome pavucontrol nwg-displays loupe sushi gnome-disk-utility mpv meld micro chromium gst-plugins-base gst-plugins-good gst-plugin-gtk4

